      "title": "ASN.1 BER dissectors: VAL_PTR pointer-sign on constrained integers",
      "message": "ASN.1 BER dissectors: VAL_PTR pointer-sign on constrained integers\n\nNote that dissect_ber_constrained_integer always has a uint32_t*\nas the value it returns. Most of these are unsigned because the\nminimum constraint is 0 or greater, but not all.\n\nPing #20175\n",
